In Scotland, every school will defer in taught languages.
Several schools will focus on the most classical modern languages, while others will teach languages that are considered the most important for the United Kingdom looking at 2020, such as Mandarin Chinese or Japanese.
No matter what your child’s interest, there will always be a number of languages to choose from in self-catering schools, with teaching staff specializing in this area.
Scotch independent schools are dedicated to providing a learning environment that will prepare children and equip them with the skills necessary for success, whatever their future.
